[% /* Generates the generation report artifact. */ %]# Generation Report

- Project: `[%= emitCtx.get("projectName") %]`
- Generator version: `[%= emitCtx.get("generatorVersion") %]`
- Primary language: `[%= emitCtx.primaryLanguage() %]`
- Planned artifacts: `[%= emitCtx.get("traceRows").size() %]`
- Manual issues: `[%= emitCtx.get("manualIssueList").size() %]`

## Artifact Kinds

[% for (kindText in emitCtx.get("traceRows").collect(rowMap | rowMap.get("artifactKind")).asSet().sortBy(kindText | kindText)) { %]
- `[%= kindText %]`: [%= emitCtx.get("traceRows").select(rowMap | rowMap.get("artifactKind") = kindText).size() %]
[% } %]

## Merge Policy

Generated files use EGL protected regions for developer-owned content where the spec permits it. JSON, ASL JSON, and generated reports are overwritten because they must remain machine-valid.

## Manual Actions

[% if (emitCtx.get("manualIssueList").isEmpty()) { %]
No manual actions were recorded by the generator.
[% } %]
[% for (issueObj in emitCtx.get("manualIssueList")) { %]
- `[%= issueObj.get("code") %]` ([%= issueObj.get("severity") %], blocking: [%= issueObj.get("blocking") %]) - [%= issueObj.get("message") %]
[% } %]

## Export Gates

- Model validation issues: [%= emitCtx.get("manualIssueList").size() %]
- Blocking production issues: [%= emitCtx.get("manualIssueList").select(issueObj | issueObj.get("blocking") = true).size() %]
- Required protected regions: [%= emitCtx.get("protectedRegionRows").select(regionObj | regionObj.get("requiredForProduction") = true).size() %]
- Artifact trace rows: [%= emitCtx.get("traceRows").size() %]
